-- CONVERSE Showcase 2: Byurakan 1971 Good-Pask-Oliver Bayesian CETI Inquiry
-- Demonstrates Pask's entailment mesh, Good's active expected-weight-of-evidence
-- questioning (DIAGNOSE), hardware DLSE combination, and live Radix-3 SETI sweep!

PRINT "=== BYURAKAN 1971 CETI EPISTEMIC INQUIRY (GOOD / PASK / OLIVER) ==="
THRESHOLD 20.0db

-- Retrieve relevant Level -7 Special Collections & Project Cyclops records
FIND "Byurakan radio Cyclops Wald deciban" TOP 3

-- Define Pask Entailment Mesh for artificial beacon confirmation
ENTAIL BEACON_ARTIFICIAL FROM NARROWBAND_CARRIER, DOPPLER_COHERENT, NON_PULSAR_SPECTRUM

-- Initial evidence: narrowband & non-pulsar confirmed, Doppler coherence still UNDECIDED!
ASSERT NARROWBAND_CARRIER AT +24.0db SOURCE "Oliver Radix-3 Bin 243"
ASSERT NON_PULSAR_SPECTRUM AT +22.5db SOURCE "Zero broadband pulse comb"
ASSERT DOPPLER_COHERENT AT +8.0db SOURCE "Initial 10-min drift track"

-- First Pask Teachback / Good Diagnosis: closure is UNDECIDED (0), names optimal next query!
DIAGNOSE BEACON_ARTIFICIAL

-- Run live Radix-3 TBFP-9C FFT + Section 8.1 TRIAD-36 Wald sweep on Duwamish-I!
SCAN SETI FRAMES 12

-- Integrate follow-up Doppler observation (+15.5 dB -> total +23.5 dB >= +20 dB!)
EVIDENCE DOPPLER_COHERENT ADD +15.5db SOURCE "Byurakan second-pass siderial lock"
WEIGH DOPPLER_COHERENT

-- Hardware 243-entry ROM DLSE combining two independent channel log-odds
COMBINE JOINT_EVIDENCE = LSE(NARROWBAND_CARRIER, NON_PULSAR_SPECTRUM)

-- Second Pask Teachback: conversational loop closes to TRUE (+1)!
DIAGNOSE BEACON_ARTIFICIAL
IF DOPPLER_COHERENT IS TRUE THEN PRINT "VERDICT LOCKED: Candidate archived to Jameson Level -9 Alexandrian Vault."
